00│  Welcome to Proqi, a prompt composer designed to replace common agent│
01│  input methods. Capture, refine, organize, and submit prompts here.│
02│  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
03│  Press Enter to edit the focused thought. Press Escape to return to│
04│  board mode.│
05│  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
06│  Press n to create a new thought, or paste in board mode to create one│
07│  from the pasted text.│
08│  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
09│  Use j or Down to move to the next thought, and k or Up to move to the│
10│  previous one. Press d to delete the focused thought and u to undo.│
11│  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
12│⋮ Proqi works on its own. Herdr adds a power-user workflow for│
